<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#cf3341">
  <title>Wally's Break Room | Staff Only</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --red: #cf3341;
      --navy: #20324b;
      --cream: #fff9eb;
      --muted: #596575;
      --border: #ded8c9;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--navy);
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .stripes {
      height: 16px;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        var(--red) 0 28px,
        #fff 28px 56px
      );
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1120px, 92%);
      margin: auto;
    }

    header {
      padding: 22px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .brand {
      color: var(--navy);
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    nav a,
    .image-link {
      color: var(--navy);
      text-underline-offset: 4px;
    }

    nav a { font-size: 14px; }
    a:hover { color: var(--red); }

    a:focus-visible,
    summary:focus-visible,
    input:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--red);
      outline-offset: 5px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 56px 0 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--red);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 16px 0;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 72px);
      line-height: 1.1;
    }

    h2 { margin-top: 0; }

    .intro {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .rhyme {
      font: italic 20px/1.8 Georgia, serif;
    }

    .badges {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin: 28px 0;
    }

    .badge {
      padding: 6px 13px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 99px;
      background: white;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
      margin: 24px 0 30px;
    }

    .card,
    .scene,
    .notes {
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: white;
    }

    .card-number {
      color: var(--red);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .card h3 { margin: 10px 0 6px; }

    .card p,
    .notes p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .scene-heading { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .scene-heading h2 { margin: 0; }

    .small {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    figure { margin: 0; }

    .image-link {
      display: block;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .scene img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    figcaption { margin-top: 14px; }

    .notes {
      background: #f7edd6;
      margin: 28px 0;
    }

    .checklist {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px 28px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .checklist label {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    input { accent-color: var(--red); }

    details {
      margin: 24px 0;
      padding: 20px 24px;
      border: 1px dashed var(--muted);
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    details p { color: var(--muted); }

    footer {
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding: 26px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero { padding-top: 36px; }
      .scene { padding: 12px; }
      .scene-heading { padding: 8px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="stripes" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <header>
    <div class="container row">
      <a class="brand" href="../">THE GREAT BEACH SEARCH</a>

      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#room">Break room</a>
        <a href="#notices">Staff notices</a>
        <a href="../">Back to the beach</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
      <span class="eyebrow">
        SCTF · Definitely Not Customer Service
      </span>

      <h1 id="page-title">
        You found Wally.<br>
        He's on his break.
      </h1>

      <p class="intro">
        All day it's “Where's Wally?” Never “How's Wally?”<br>
        Welcome to the one room he hoped nobody would find.
      </p>

      <p class="rhyme">
        You left the beach and found my chair,<br>
        A quiet cup, a weary stare.<br>
        Before you leave me to my tea,<br>
        Look closer at what's here with me.
      </p>

      <div class="badges" aria-label="Room information">
        <span class="badge">Access: Somehow you got in</span>
        <span class="badge">Wally: Off duty</span>
        <span class="badge">Coffee: Emotionally necessary</span>
        <span class="badge">Meetings: Absolutely not</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cards" aria-label="Break room rules">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="card-number">01 / ARRIVAL</span>
        <h3>You weren't on the guest list.</h3>
        <p>
          There isn't a guest list. That's the whole point.
          Still, points for persistence.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="card-number">02 / ETIQUETTE</span>
        <h3>Respect the sacred brew.</h3>
        <p>
          Do not touch the mug. Do not schedule a meeting.
          Do not say “just a quick question.”
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <span class="card-number">03 / DEPARTURE</span>
        <h3>Take a good look around.</h3>
        <p>
          You found the room. Your next discovery might require
          a little more attention.
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="scene" id="room" aria-labelledby="room-title">
      <div class="row scene-heading">
        <h2 id="room-title">Wally's very private break room</h2>
        <span class="small">OCCUPANCY: ONE TOO MANY</span>
      </div>

      <figure>
        <a
          class="image-link"
          href="../Images/wally-break-room-permit.png"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          aria-label="Open the break room illustration at full size in a new tab"
        >
          <img
            src="../Images/wally-break-room-permit.png"
            alt="Wally relaxing with a hot drink in a staff break room."
            width="1672"
            height="941"
          >
        </a>

        <figcaption class="row small">
          <span>
            Click the picture to inspect it at full size in a new tab.
          </span>
          <span>Please admire quietly.</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="notes" id="notices" aria-labelledby="notices-title">
      <span class="eyebrow">
        Noticeboard · Please pretend you read this
      </span>

      <h2 id="notices-title">A few words from management</h2>

      <p>
        The last biscuit is not a team-building exercise.
        Label your lunch. Anyone asking Wally to “hide somewhere else”
        will be assigned beach umbrella inventory.
      </p>

      <div class="checklist">
        <label>
          <input type="checkbox">
          Found the staff entrance
        </label>

        <label>
          <input type="checkbox">
          Interrupted a perfectly good break
        </label>

        <label>
          <input type="checkbox">
          Inspected the room
        </label>

        <label>
          <input type="checkbox">
          Left the biscuit alone
        </label>
      </div>
    </section>

    <details>
      <summary>Ask Wally for a hint</summary>
      <p>
        “I had to get paperwork approved just to sit down.
        Have a look at the coffee table. And yes, you can
        enlarge the picture.”
      </p>
    </details>

    <details>
      <summary>Speak to the manager</summary>
      <p>
        The manager is also hiding.
        We have a bit of a company culture problem.
      </p>
    </details>
  </main>

  <footer class="small">
    <div class="container">
      <p>The Great Beach Search · Staff Facilities Division</p>
      <p>If anyone asks, you never saw this room.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <div class="stripes" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</body>
</html>
